00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:14.610
I made a vow to be beside Takuto.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.030
I don't want to go anywhere.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.580
I want to be with Takuto!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.500
Tanarotte!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.040
Wait! I'm helping you now!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.180
Too bad.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:29.170
Human power is useless against that.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.800
Takuto-sama! I shall now...

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.970
Werewolf?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.550
No, you're not.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.850
A Virgest's sealed form?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:43.140
Byakko versus Virgest, such a nice match.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.730
A pity that we have such a small audience.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.740
Good swordsmanship.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:56.950
Same goes for you.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.000
Wait! Wait!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.460
Wait!!!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.920
My little kitten.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.920
Gotcha!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.550
What the hell is this?!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.310
Damn.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:23.850
Eine-san!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.900
With my name and skill, I execute!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.020
I am Hasegawa Takuto,

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.690
user of supernatural rule and law.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:37.110
With the power of fire and your heat, burn away my enemies!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.070
Useless!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.000
Takuto!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.210
It looks like the game is set.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.210
You shall sleep there.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.800
For ever!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:54.590
Takuto!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.090
Tanarotte!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.360
Sempai!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.360
What is this?

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.530
What?

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:22.580
How could the sacred <i>moe</i> item be a pair of fake glasses?!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.710
Don't mess with me!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.540
Glasses must be real!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.800
Glasses are not a fashion!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.960
No! It must never be!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:39.580
The short-sighted girl takes a quick glance from over the top of her glasses

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:42.760
with upturned eyes to ascertain what she sees.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:48.940
Oh the excitement of imagining what will happen if she didn't have those glasses.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.610
<i>Moe</i> only works because of reality with all of these included.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.650
Yet, you...

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.280
Yet...!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:59.240
Your sin of toying my pure heart with fake <i>moe</i>...

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.160
You deserve to die a million times!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:04.700
Godly punishment!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.760
Oh, I can move my body.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:17.510
Oh no.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:21.010
For all you've done so far,

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.470
It's payback time!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.700
Oh, they've returned back.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:54.950
No!!!! My Mimigar-Z!

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.130
I'm toast.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.420
No worth in my life.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.510
Takuto!

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:02.510
Tanarotte.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.970
Good, good...

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:11.020
Oh my, it seems all hell broke loose while I was away.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.050
Professor Sagami?

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:21.740
I see, the mysterious Tanarotte-chan can turn out to be a God or a Demon.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:23.750
Sempai...

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.700
But nothing is for certain yet.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:30.160
This is just a case of Gods and Demons acting without thinking.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:33.870
And what do the Gods and Demons say?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.670
They just keep the stance that they know nothing and are not affiliated at all.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.340
Umm, that means?

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.510
If they say they don't know,

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.340
then you probably don't have to do anything.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.450
We'll keep the present state about Tanarotte-chan.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:47.850
Sempai!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.600
I'm always with you from now on!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.980
And so.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:05.990
That means you two snuck into this school under your own authority.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.990
- Next day -
- Next day -

